        "subject": "LU-18687 lnet: use the kernel timer API in net_fault",
        "message": "LU-18687 lnet: use the kernel timer API in net_fault\n\nThe delay rule timer was the last user of cfs_timer_setup(),\ncfs_from_timer() and cfs_timer_cb_arg_t.  Use timer_setup() and\ntimer_container_of() and remove the cfs_timer_*() wrappers from the\nlustre_compat timer.h shim.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: If6c7ad6c874d0bb2dc4ab3bad2f215226a6a6964\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
